The '''Critter Safari Entrance''' is a [[Location]] found on the {{zone|Torrhus Canyon}}. It serves as the entrance to the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}.

{{ZoneText|&7Talk to the &2Safari Manager &7to enter the &2Critter Safari&7.|&7Talk to &aAndrea &7to view your &2Safari Milestones&7.|&7Talk to &6Archie &7to view the &2Safari Essence Shop&7.}}
== Features ==
The '''Critter Safari Entrance''' serves as the introduction and entry point to the {{Zone|Critter Safari}}. Players can access the Safari by speaking to the {{NPCSprite|Safari Manager}} and using [[Safari Tickets]], which can be obtained from {{NPCSprite|Miria}}'s [[Starlyn Contest]]s.

The {{NPCSprite|Safari Receptionist}} gives players information about the Safari. Upstairs, {{NPCSprite|Andrea}} gives players the {{Item|Safari Belt}}, which can be upgraded through [[Safari Milestones]], and {{NPCSprite|Archie}} hosts the {{Item|Safari Essence}} Shop.

